{"ref":"BDB, עֹבֵד אֱדֹם","hw":"עֹבֵד אֱדֹם","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">עֹבֵד אֱדֹם</span></big>  and (<a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 25:24\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.25.24\">2 Ch 25:24</a>) <span dir=\"rtl\">ע׳אֱדוֹם</span> <strong>n.pr.m. (</strong><em>servant of</em> (god) <em>Edom</em>, cf. <a data-ref=\"BDB, אדם²\" href=\"/BDB,_אדם²\", dir=\"rtl\">עבד אדם</a> CIS<sup>No. 295</sup>; Dr<sup>Sm 206, 293</sup> and reff., RS<sup>Sem i. 43; 2nd ed. 42</sup> and reff., HPS <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 6:10\" href=\"/II_Samuel.6.10\">2 S 6:10</a>; but Bae<sup>Rel 10</sup> <em>servant of man</em>, <span dir=\"rtl\">אֱדֹם</span> = <span dir=\"rtl\">אָדָם</span>, which is thought possible by Nö<sup>ZMG xlii (1888), 470</sup> Buhl<sup>Edomiter 49</sup><strong>)</strong>;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  the Hittite who harboured the ark <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 6:10\" href=\"/II_Samuel.6.10\">2 S 6:10</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 6:11\" href=\"/II_Samuel.6.11\">11</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 6:12\" href=\"/II_Samuel.6.12\">12</a><sup>(×2)</sup> = <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 13:13\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.13.13\">1 Ch 13:13</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 13:14\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.13.14\">14</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 15:25\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.15.25\">1 Ch 15:25</a>; 𝔊 Αβεδδαρα, 𝔊L Αβεδδαδαν.<br><strong>2.</strong>  (= <strong>1</strong>?) one of the chief Levitical singers and doorkeepers <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 15:18\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.15.18\">1 Ch 15:18</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 15:21\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.15.21\">21</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 15:24\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.15.24\">24</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 16:5\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.16.5\">16:5</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 16:38\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.16.38\">38</a><sup>(×2)</sup>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 26:4\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.26.4\">26:4</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 26:8\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.26.8\">8</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 26:1